1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 22]

34
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:41,640
Guards.

35
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:45,040
Take His Highness back.

36
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:51,790
Fine.

37
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,150
Back to the palace.

38
00:01:58,070 --> 00:01:58,710
Back to the palace.

39
00:01:59,230 --> 00:01:59,710
Go.

40
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,800
Useless woman.

41
00:02:12,750 --> 00:02:14,680
Raised her son into a fool.

42
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,030
What a waste.

43
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:19,750
Pei Zhao takes after you in your youth.

44
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:20,910
But,

45
00:02:21,430 --> 00:02:23,190
he won't stand with you.

46
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:26,960
He is a lot like I was.

47
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:28,870
Smart and steady.

48
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:30,080
Hard on himself too.

49
00:02:31,430 --> 00:02:32,240
If he

50
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:34,080
would call me Father,

51
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:37,470
I'd give him another chance.

52
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:41,560
This dead end

53
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:43,430
was his own choice.

54
00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:47,560
No one else to blame.

55
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:56,110
Enough.

56
00:02:56,870 --> 00:02:57,870
Go back.

57
00:03:22,910 --> 00:03:23,710
Yun Shao.

58
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,750
Yun Shao.

59
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:28,590
Come.

60
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,470
Have a few drinks

61
00:03:30,470 --> 00:03:31,240
with me.

62
00:03:37,710 --> 00:03:40,310
What's fun about making these all day?

63
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:41,680
Come on.

64
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:44,120
Let's go drink.

65
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:48,000
You're drunk, Your Highness.

66
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,430
Please control yourself.

67
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,280
Yun Shao.

68
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,030
Yun Shao.

69
00:03:55,910 --> 00:03:56,630
Yun Shao.

70
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:57,960
Don't avoid me.

71
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,960
You know how I feel.

72
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,080
I don't.

73
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,190
I love you.

74
00:04:10,150 --> 00:04:11,750
I want your heart.

75
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:16,070
You know?

76
00:04:17,630 --> 00:04:18,830
Everything in my life,

77
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,160
every choice,

78
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,270
every possession,

79
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:24,360
was all arranged by Mother Consort.

80
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,480
But you're different.

81
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:29,750
You are

82
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:33,800
all I truly want.

83
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:35,630
Your Highness.

84
00:04:36,510 --> 00:04:37,390
The ritual is near.

85
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:39,240
Don't you want it to succeed?

86
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:46,270
The ritual doesn't matter.

87
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:48,630
The throne is mine.

88
00:04:48,630 --> 00:04:49,830
No one can take it.

89
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,950
Once I take the throne,

90
00:04:52,510 --> 00:04:54,870
I'll be a great and benevolent ruler.

91
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,000
You're that sure?

92
00:05:04,870 --> 00:05:05,600
Fine.

93
00:05:06,970 --> 00:05:09,240
I'll tell you the truth.

94
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,720
The ritual in three days

95
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,070
is a trap.

96
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:16,310
Everyone who mocked me

97
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,920
or looked down on me will die.

98
00:05:20,830 --> 00:05:21,360
Yun Shao.

99
00:05:21,990 --> 00:05:23,870
Give me your heart,

100
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:26,120
and we'll share this realm.

101
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,510
But if you won't...

102
00:05:29,950 --> 00:05:30,560
If I won't,

103
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:32,310
what then?

104
00:05:37,310 --> 00:05:40,720
Then you'll become the real sacrifice.

105
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,630
Did you bring what I asked for?

106
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:09,650
Think carefully.

107
00:06:10,270 --> 00:06:11,560
Drawing the Child Gu into yourself

108
00:06:11,830 --> 00:06:13,680
may harmonize the Mother and Child Gu.

109
00:06:13,810 --> 00:06:14,720
But from then on,

110
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,830
every bone in your body will ache.

111
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,360
And that pain

112
00:06:18,810 --> 00:06:20,190
will never go away.

113
00:06:20,910 --> 00:06:21,600
Worse,

114
00:06:22,070 --> 00:06:23,260
if you ever collapse,

115
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,510
you may never stand again.

116
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:29,000
Lord Pei.

117
00:06:30,070 --> 00:06:30,600
Are you sure

118
00:06:30,870 --> 00:06:31,720
you won't reconsider?

119
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:32,750
There's no time.

120
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:38,120
What am I supposed to tell Yun Shao?

121
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:40,950
Don't tell her.

122
00:06:41,430 --> 00:06:42,750
This has nothing to do with her.

123
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,240
She was dragged into this

124
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:46,040
because of me.

125
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,240
Lord Pei.

126
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:21,560
Actually,

127
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:23,720
I used to envy you.

128
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,070
Back then,

129
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,720
I was forced to study all day,

130
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,270
never allowed to slack off.

131
00:07:32,870 --> 00:07:34,070
You were different.

132
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:38,600
You stayed in that pretty room all day

133
00:07:39,630 --> 00:07:42,000
and still got
Father's and Mother's praise.

134
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,510
I envied you too.

135
00:07:47,410 --> 00:07:48,980
You could come and go as you pleased.

136
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:52,190
I was trapped in the back courtyard,

137
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:54,920
forbidden to leave the mansion.

138
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,630
You really should envy me.

139
00:08:04,430 --> 00:08:05,510
You're a princess.

140
00:08:06,830 --> 00:08:07,680
So what?

141
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:11,070
You're still a stray with nowhere to go.

142
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:14,720
Brother Yun Qi is dead.

143
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,000
The Noble Consort is aging.

144
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:20,070
Soon she'll be discarded too.

145
00:08:20,070 --> 00:08:20,680
But I'll

146
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,360
be the Yuns' pillar.

147
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:26,270
The Yun family will

148
00:08:27,070 --> 00:08:28,390
be proud of me.

149
00:08:33,750 --> 00:08:34,630
Congratulations.

150
00:08:35,870 --> 00:08:36,510
Stop pretending.

151
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:40,870
You must be terrified

152
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:42,270
right now.

153
00:08:43,510 --> 00:08:44,440
But this time,

154
00:08:45,740 --> 00:08:46,910
you won't escape.

155
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:49,600
Sister.

156
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:55,360
You're the one who won't escape.

157
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:03,080
Let go of me.

158
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,080
Yun Heng is yours to deal with.

159
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:58,240
I've done everything I promised.

160
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,790
Now answer me.

161
00:10:00,750 --> 00:10:01,790
What do you choose?

162
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:03,790
The sacrifice.

163
00:10:04,910 --> 00:10:06,150
I'll give you my blood on time.

164
00:10:14,060 --> 00:10:18,460
[Mountain Vista]

165
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,670
Once Yun Shao's blood is drained,

166
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:37,030
Qingyan's ritual will succeed.

167
00:10:37,790 --> 00:10:38,600
Jin.

168
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:41,320
Your son will soon take the throne.

169
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,670
Aren't you happy?

170
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:44,200
Of course.

171
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,360
Then would you

172
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:50,670
give him the military tally?

173
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,390
The military tally...

174
00:10:58,670 --> 00:10:59,480
Jin.

175
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,030
We're not young anymore.

176
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:06,150
I only want to spend my life with you.

177
00:11:06,870 --> 00:11:09,670
Let Qingyan and Zhao rule.

178
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:12,320
Then every day,

179
00:11:13,150 --> 00:11:14,250
we can travel together,

180
00:11:14,510 --> 00:11:15,560
enjoy our wealth,

181
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:17,030
wouldn't that be wonderful?

182
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,750
Ah.

183
00:11:22,750 --> 00:11:23,670
You're right.

184
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,320
In the blink of an eye,

185
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:28,870
we're both in our forties.

186
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,320
But for now,

187
00:11:36,390 --> 00:11:37,870
Qingyan is still young,

188
00:11:38,870 --> 00:11:41,390
and Zhao isn't on our side.

189
00:11:43,450 --> 00:11:44,170
In a few years.

190
00:11:44,790 --> 00:11:46,000
I'll go with you then.

191
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,120
In a few years?

192
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:53,790
You won't give up command now.

193
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,870
Is it because you never meant

194
00:11:55,870 --> 00:11:57,270
to let your son take the throne?

195
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,780
Of course not.

196
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,030
No?

197
00:12:00,030 --> 00:12:00,630
No.

198
00:12:03,970 --> 00:12:04,720
Bring him in.

199
00:12:17,150 --> 00:12:17,910
Leave us.

200
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,670
Answer me.

201
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,510
Why station troops outside the city?

202
00:12:39,150 --> 00:12:40,480
What are you planning?

203
00:12:52,900 --> 00:12:53,670
Yun Jin.

204
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,510
You and I

205
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,120
stood together half our lives.

206
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:04,240
Now we turn our swords on each other.

207
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:07,550
Fine.

208
00:13:10,670 --> 00:13:11,670
Very well.

209
00:13:16,150 --> 00:13:19,320
The last ritual failed.

210
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,390
That was Heaven's will.

211
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:28,120
Qingyan is weak and useless.

212
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:31,840
Zhao won't serve us.

213
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:35,030
The realm belongs to the capable.

214
00:13:38,390 --> 00:13:42,510
I've summoned every official here.

215
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,120
Today,

216
00:13:49,750 --> 00:13:51,320
those with me prosper.

217
00:13:52,390 --> 00:13:53,630
Those against me

218
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:56,870
die.

219
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:01,670
You want the throne?

220
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:04,750
You've lost your mind.

221
00:14:23,750 --> 00:14:24,840
Before my first campaign,

222
00:14:26,670 --> 00:14:27,510
you gave me this.

223
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,320
Take it back.

224
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:38,600
Give me Zhao's cure
for the mother-child Gu.

225
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,080
Give it to me.

226
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:42,720
There is no cure.

227
00:14:51,260 --> 00:14:52,870
You stole Qingyan's throne

228
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:54,550
and put Gu in Zhao.

229
00:14:55,760 --> 00:14:57,870
You'd sacrifice both our sons.

230
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:01,240
No one hurts my sons.

231
00:15:02,910 --> 00:15:04,010
Not even you.

232
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,850
What a show.

233
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,630
Your Highness, what now?

234
00:15:17,870 --> 00:15:18,670
Heh.

235
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:30,910
Jin.

236
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:32,320
Jin.

237
00:15:37,470 --> 00:15:38,080
Physician.

238
00:15:38,640 --> 00:15:39,600
Get the physician.

239
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:41,910
Jin.

240
00:15:42,590 --> 00:15:43,060
Jin.

241
00:15:45,940 --> 00:15:46,450
Jin.

242
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:49,550
You vicious woman.

243
00:15:51,360 --> 00:15:53,200
You turned against me first.

244
00:15:54,670 --> 00:15:55,840
It was your son's throne.

245
00:15:56,510 --> 00:15:57,720
Couldn't you just let him have it?

246
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:59,320
Why take it for yourself?

247
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:01,870
Jin.

248
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,270
The dagger...

249
00:16:07,390 --> 00:16:08,320
It's poisoned.

250
00:16:14,870 --> 00:16:15,460
Poisoned?

251
00:16:22,030 --> 00:16:22,440
Mother Consort.

252
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,320
Things are rather chaotic.

253
00:16:24,670 --> 00:16:25,600
In case anything goes wrong,

254
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,080
keep this for protection.

255
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:28,840
All right.

256
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,150
Get up.

257
00:16:33,390 --> 00:16:34,390
Get up now.

258
00:16:35,030 --> 00:16:35,750
Tell me.

259
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,480
Where's the cure?

260
00:16:38,870 --> 00:16:39,790
Where is it?

261
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:47,910
The cure...

262
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:52,150
Mother Consort.

263
00:16:52,150 --> 00:16:53,630
Why did you kill Prince of Xin'an?

264
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:15,270
Qingyan.

265
00:17:16,510 --> 00:17:18,680
He was your real father.

266
00:17:21,350 --> 00:17:23,030
I'm Crown Prince of Yong.

267
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:26,440
I have only one father.

268
00:17:34,550 --> 00:17:35,880
The Crown Prince has arrived.

269
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:43,550
The blood jade bears Heaven's sign.

270
00:17:43,550 --> 00:17:47,880
The Crown Prince
receives the Mandate of Heaven.

271
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:54,000
All officials bow,
and the realm rejoices.

272
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:32,250
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

273
00:18:33,870 --> 00:18:37,060
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

274
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:40,120
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

275
00:18:40,620 --> 00:18:45,060
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

276
00:18:47,220 --> 00:18:49,890
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

277
00:18:51,110 --> 00:18:56,120
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

278
00:18:56,440 --> 00:19:04,470
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

279
00:19:04,740 --> 00:19:13,360
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

280
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:22,030
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

281
00:19:22,410 --> 00:19:31,280
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

282
00:19:31,710 --> 00:19:40,200
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
